Episode 16
Eternal Heartfelt Loyalty

00:09:52.000 --> 00:09:57.970
Shimousa, Nagareyama

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:29.600
<i>Romance of the Three Kingdoms</i>

00:10:25.130 --> 00:10:29.600
<i>Biography of Kiyomasa</i>

00:10:29.600 --> 00:10:31.500
<i>Water Margin</i>

00:20:07.180 --> 00:20:18.990
Akane sasu yuuhi ga terasu yokogao wo mitsume
I stare into your face, illuminated by the dark red setting sun

00:20:18.990 --> 00:20:30.940
Sotto negau moyuru sora yo toki wo tomete ite
I softly wish upon the burning sky to stop time

00:20:31.740 --> 00:20:42.550
Kanashimi wo seoite hitamuki ni susumu anata
You earnestly try to move forward as you bear your sadness

00:20:42.550 --> 00:20:55.630
Kanau naraba oikakete yukitai kewashiki kono michi wo
If possible, I want to follow you down this rugged path

00:20:55.630 --> 00:21:02.530
Tooku, tooku nagaruru kumo
The clouds flow by in the far, far distance

00:21:02.530 --> 00:21:07.870
Tatoe ima ga hakanaku to mo
Even if this moment lasts but a moment

00:21:07.870 --> 00:21:11.010
Soba ni itai
I want to be with you

00:21:11.010 --> 00:21:21.780
Kono kokoro wo someyuku hi wa tokoshie dakara
The sun that dyes my heart will last forever

00:21:22.120 --> 00:21:27.950
Kizuna dake shinjite
So just believe in our bonds

00:21:36.370 --> 00:21:48.210
Kototoeba namida ga afureteshimau ki ga shite
I think my tears may begin to brim over if I say anything

00:21:48.210 --> 00:22:00.320
Sora wo miage damatte ita yuuyami no naka de
I silently looked up to the sky in the dark of twilight

00:22:00.990 --> 00:22:06.760
Moshi donna sadame ni
No matter what my fate

00:22:06.760 --> 00:22:11.770
Au to mo kuyami wa shinai
I will have no regrets so long as

00:22:11.770 --> 00:22:19.410
Itoshi mimune soeru hi wo yume mite
I can accompany you while dreaming of

00:22:19.410 --> 00:22:24.850
Tsuite yukeru no nara
The day I nuzzle into your dear chest

00:22:24.850 --> 00:22:31.790
Awaku awaku kieyuku sora
Ever so slowly the sky fades

00:22:31.790 --> 00:22:37.160
Toki ga subete nuri kaete mo
Even if the seasons paint themselves yet again

00:22:37.160 --> 00:22:40.200
Koko ni imasu
I will still be here

00:22:40.200 --> 00:22:51.170
Kono kokoro ni sakishi ai wo towa ni dakishime
I will embrace the love blossoming in my heart forever

00:22:51.380 --> 00:22:57.410
Yuukyuu no hate made
Until the end of eternity

00:23:13.470 --> 00:23:15.470
Next time
A Fleeting Dream
